    "raw": "The Vat'iish are a prideful faction and, while they are intelligent, they scorn the Kir'vat and their 'cowardly' ways, choosing instead to forge the path of the warrior. They use the galaxy as their own personal trophy cabinet, sieging inhabited worlds and taking over the settlements that may be stationed there, just to show that they can. They are cunning, deceitful, and will never do anything for anyone without a good incentive to do so.",
    "value": "瓦特力士是一支高傲的派系。虽天资聪颖，却鄙夷基尔瓦特派及其所谓“懦弱”行径，转而踏上战士之道。他们将宇宙视作私人的战利品陈列柜，攻掠有人居住的星球，接管其上可能存在的定居点，仅为了证明自己有此能力。此派狡诈多端、工于心计，若无足够利益驱使，绝不会为他人施以半分援手。"
